  "desc": "A pitched diphone vowel sung as a low, sultry trip-hop phrase over a d-dorian line \u2014 dark filter, warm shape and a dusty micro-detune keep it smoky. Sparse breathes one bluesy figure per cycle; full answers itself with an octave-up off() canon and a phrase-end lift; peak chops and jux-reverses the line into a rainy, drenched double under long dub delay. Nocturnal, intimate, downtempo.",
